Adaptations are limited to: rewriting import paths to
github.com/owner/lightspeed/internal/gopls/..., extracting the small set of
generated LSP type declarations needed by the copied files into
protocol/types.go, omitting SelectCompletionTextEdit from edits.go (depends
on completion types out of scope here), replacing a testenv.NeedsTool call
with an exec.LookPath skip in diff_test.go, and reimplementing the bug
package as a trivial shim.

